						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: OSCILLATOR ANIMATION\n\nWe used a lot of oscillators for this generator.\nOscillators are used  to both change the shape and rotation of the rectangle.\nThe various frequency, amplitude and  (phase)offset values are found through experimentation."
