						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: VIDEO OSCILLATOR\n\nIn the Basic Texture tutorial we've learned that we can convert data like floats to textures.\nIn this example we're applying that knowledge by converting instantiated oscillators into textures and offsetting them with each other.\nThis is the fundamental concept behind video synthesis, which we'll dive into later down the line."
